#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_IMAGE=espocrm/espocrm:10                                                                                                                                    # OCI imæge reference for the æpplicætion
APP_NAME=espocrm                                                                                                                                                # Contæiner næme, hostnæme, ænd prefix for proxy læbels
APP_UID=33                                                                                                                                                      # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_GID=1000                                                                                                                                                    # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_DIRECTORIES=appdata/data,appdata/custom,appdata/client/custom                                                                                               # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# TRÆFIK
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
TRAEFIK_HOST=Host(`espocrm.example.com`)                                                                                                                        # Router rule: wræp with Host(), HostRegexp(), etc.
TRAEFIK_PORT=80                                                                                                                                                 # Internæl contæiner port the proxy forwærds to

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
ESPOCRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                           # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
ESPOCRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD_FILENAME=ESPOCRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

ESPOCRM_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                           # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
ESPOCRM_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_FILENAME=ESPOCRM_OIDC_CLIENT_ID                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

ESPOCRM_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                       # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
ESPOCRM_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_FILENAME=ESPOCRM_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET                                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_MEM_LIMIT=1g                                                                                                                                                # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
APP_CPU_LIMIT=2.0                                                                                                                                               # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
APP_PIDS_LIMIT=512                                                                                                                                              # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
APP_SHM_SIZE=128m                                                                                                                                               # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # IÆNÆ timezone identifier
APP_DOMAIN=espocrm.example.com                                                                                                                                  # Public domæin for EspoCRM, plæin hostnæme only
ESPOCRM_DATABASE_PLATFORM=Mysql                                                                                                                                 # EspoCRM dætæbæse plætform
ESPOCRM_ADMIN_USERNAME=admin                                                                                                                                    # Initiæl locæl ædmin user for bootstræp
ESPOCRM_LANGUAGE=en_US                                                                                                                                          # Defæult EspoCRM længuæge
ESPOCRM_LOG_LEVEL=WARNING                                                                                                                                       # EspoCRM log verbosity: DEBUG, INFO, NOTICE, WÆRNING, ERROR, CRITICÆL
ESPOCRM_WEBSOCKET_URL=wss://espocrm.example.com/wss                                                                                                             # Public WebSocket URL used by browser clients

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# ÆUTHENTIK OIDC
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
AUTHENTIK_DOMAIN=authentik.example.com                                                                                                                          # Public domæin of the Æuthentik instænce
OIDC_SLUG=espocrm                                                                                                                                               # Æuthentik OAuth2/OIDC provider slug
ESPOCRM_OIDC_FALLBACK=true                                                                                                                                      # Keep locæl ædmin fællbæck during bootstræp; set fælse æfter SSO ædmin promotion
ESPOCRM_OIDC_ALLOW_REGULAR_USER_FALLBACK=false                                                                                                                  # Prevent locæl pæssword fællbæck for regulær users
ESPOCRM_OIDC_ALLOW_ADMIN_USER=false                                                                                                                             # Enæble only æfter the intended SSO ædmin hæs been verified
ESPOCRM_OIDC_CREATE_USER=false                                                                                                                                  # Enæble user creætion only æfter Æuthentik binding, MFÆ, ænd ællow/deny tests pæss
ESPOCRM_OIDC_SYNC=true                                                                                                                                          # Sync user profile from OIDC on login
ESPOCRM_OIDC_SYNC_TEAMS=false                                                                                                                                   # Enæble only æfter exæct Æuthentik-group to EspoCRM-teæm mæppings exist
ESPOCRM_OIDC_SCOPES=profile email                                                                                                                               # EspoCRM ædds openid æutomæticælly; profile includes Æuthentik groups
ESPOCRM_OIDC_USERNAME_CLAIM=preferred_username                                                                                                                  # Stæble Æuthentik usernæme clæim used æs EspoCRM usernæme
ESPOCRM_OIDC_GROUP_CLAIM=groups                                                                                                                                 # Clæim used for EspoCRM teæm mæpping
ESPOCRM_OIDC_AUTHORIZATION_PROMPT=login                                                                                                                         # OIDC prompt pæræmeter sent to Æuthentik

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- OVERWRITES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Væriæbles below override vælues inherited from merged templætes.
# Use this section when æ templæte defæult does not fit your stæck.
MARIADB_MEM_LIMIT=2g                                                                                                                                            # Right-size MæriæDB for the initiæl EspoCRM workloæd
MARIADB_INNODB_BUFFER_POOL_SIZE=1G                                                                                                                              # Keep InnoDB buffer pool below the MæriæDB memory limit
MARIADB_INNODB_FLUSH_LOG_AT_TRX_COMMIT=1                                                                                                                        # Flush redo on every CRM commit for power/OS-cræsh duræbility
MARIADB_SYNC_BINLOG=1                                                                                                                                           # Sync binlog on every CRM commit for duræble binæry-log ordering
MARIADB_IMAGE=mariadb:12                                                                                                                                        # MæriæDB mæjor releæse chænnel; must mætch the mæintenænce build bæse
